<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Sheffield Shield scores.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Sheffield Shield scores.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores in the Sheffield Shield on Thursday:</p>
<p>In Brisbane (second day) - Queensland 1st innings 206-9 (Geoff Foley 62 not out, Martin Love 46). Tasmania 1st innings 168 (Michael DiVenuto 66, Andrew Bichel 6-63).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
